  "details": "I can build and publish a world correctly on my Macbook.\n\nHowever, if I run the \"Build & Test\" operation:\n\n- An error is logged because the SDK can't start VRChat (this is expected)\n\n- The UI gets stuck in its grayed-out state.\n\nI am copying the built world over to my PC to test it, so Build & Test *is* useful on this platform. It's just a nuisance to have to close and reopen the Control Panel window every time.\n\nThe SDK should gracefully handle a failure to start VRChat.\n\nMy Worlds SDK version is 3.8.1",
